    dct:description "Module and function docstrings map every governing equation to Tero et al. (2010) Science Eqs. 1-3 & Figs. 2-4, Tero, Kobayashi & Nakagaki (2007) J. Theor. Biol. Eqs. 1-4 & Section 2.2, Murray (1926) PNAS, and the 3 formal Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_057_physarum_transport_network.lean` (L1-47, L192-509)." ;
